art Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Rumored-Home-Products-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Rumored-Home-Products-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16267,\"date\":\"2026-07-15T12:33:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-15T10:33:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"primo-dispositivo-ai-openai-smart-speaker-portatile-senza-display\",\"title\":\"Il primo dispositivo AI di OpenAI: uno smart speaker portatile senza display\",\"excerpt\":\"OpenAI starebbe preparando il suo primo prodotto hardware: uno smart speaker mobile senza display, pensato come “compagno” AI in casa. Al centro anche una disputa legale con Apple.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/openai-chatgpt-logo-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"openai-chatgpt-logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15953,\"date\":\"2026-07-04T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-04T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-16-nuovi-prodotti-seconda-meta-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple, i rumor su 16 nuovi prodotti nella seconda metà del 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo l’arrivo in beta della nuova Siri più personale, i rumor indicano aggiornamenti per iPhone, Apple Watch, iPad, Mac e la piattaforma smart home: dal possibile iPhone Ultra pieghevole al nuovo Home Hub.\",\"categoryName\":\"Smart Home\",\"categorySlug\":\"smart-home\",\"categoryId\":11,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Apple-Event-Logo-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Event-Logo\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15956,\"date\":\"2026-07-03T08:44:0